{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 工具调用与MCP MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"MCP 安全模型和权限控制\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用与MCP\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工具调用\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工具调用与MCP MOC</a></p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">MCP 的安全模型是怎样的？如何实现工具调用的权限控制和审计？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">MCP 的安全模型遵循<strong>最小权限原则</strong>，从工具注册、调用审批、执行隔离到审计追踪形成完整的安全闭环。</p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"MCP 安全架构\" dir=\"auto\">MCP 安全架构</h3>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                       Host 层                            │\n│  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────────┐ │\n│  │ 用户认证     │  │ 权限策略     │  │ 审计日志         │ │\n│  │ (OAuth/JWT) │  │ (RBAC/ABAC) │  │ (全链路追踪)      │ │\n│  └──────┬──────┘  └──────┬──────┘  └─────────────────┘ │\n└─────────┼────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┘\n          │                │\n    ┌─────▼─────┐   ┌─────▼─────┐\n    │  Client   │   │ 审批网关   │\n    │  连接管理  │   │ (人工/自动)│\n    └─────┬─────┘   └─────┬─────┘\n          │                │\n    ┌─────▼───────────────▼─────┐\n    │         Server 层          │\n    │  ┌─────────┐ ┌─────────┐ │\n    │  │工具权限  │ │资源隔离  │ │\n    │  │(允许列表)│ │(沙箱)   │ │\n    │  └─────────┘ └─────────┘ │\n    └────────────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"权限控制四层模型\" dir=\"auto\">权限控制四层模型</h3>\n<h4 data-heading=\"第一层：工具级权限（Tool-level ACL）\" dir=\"auto\">第一层：工具级权限（Tool-level ACL）</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ToolACL</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"工具访问控制列表\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>permissions <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 用户角色 -&gt; 允许调用的工具（支持通配符）</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"admin\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 所有工具</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"analyst\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"query_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"search_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"export_report\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"operator\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"query_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"update_status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"send_notification\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"guest\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"query_public_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 只能查询公开数据</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">can_execute</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_role<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        allowed_patterns <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>permissions<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_role<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> pattern <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> allowed_patterns<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> pattern <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"*\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">or</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_match<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>pattern<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_match</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> pattern<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> fnmatch\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> fnmatch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>fnmatch<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> pattern<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 使用</span>\nacl <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ToolACL<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">assert</span> acl<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>can_execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"admin\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"delete_database\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">assert</span> acl<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>can_execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"analyst\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"delete_database\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">assert</span> acl<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>can_execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"analyst\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"query_sales\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"第二层：操作风险分级（Risk-based Approval）\" dir=\"auto\">第二层：操作风险分级（Risk-based Approval）</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> enum <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Enum\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">RiskLevel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>Enum<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    LOW <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"low\"</span>       <span class=\"token comment\"># 只读查询，自动执行</span>\n    MEDIUM <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"medium\"</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 一般操作，记录日志</span>\n    HIGH <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"high\"</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># 敏感操作，需自动审批</span>\n    CRITICAL <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"critical\"</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 危险操作，需人工审批</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">RiskBasedApprover</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"基于风险等级的审批系统\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    RISK_MAP <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"query_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> RiskLevel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>LOW<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"search_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> RiskLevel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>LOW<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"export_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> RiskLevel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>MEDIUM<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"update_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> RiskLevel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>HIGH<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"delete_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> RiskLevel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>CRITICAL<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"transfer_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> RiskLevel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>CRITICAL<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"send_email\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> RiskLevel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>HIGH<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"exec_shell\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> RiskLevel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>CRITICAL<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">assess</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> RiskLevel<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"评估操作风险等级\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> pattern<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> risk <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>RISK_MAP<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>items<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_match<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>pattern<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 额外判断参数敏感程度</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_has_sensitive_args<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> RiskLevel<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token builtin\">min</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>risk<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> RiskLevel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>CRITICAL<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> risk\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> RiskLevel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>MEDIUM  <span class=\"token comment\"># 默认中风险</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_has_sensitive_args</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> args<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"检查参数是否涉及敏感信息\"\"\"</span>\n        sensitive_keys <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'password'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'token'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'secret'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'ssn'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'credit_card'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">any</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>k <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>args<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lower<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> k <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> sensitive_keys<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 使用</span>\napprover <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> RiskBasedApprover<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nrisk <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> approver<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>assess<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"delete_user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"user_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"12345\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> risk <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>RiskLevel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>HIGH<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> RiskLevel<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>CRITICAL<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 需要审批流程</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"第三层：执行隔离（Execution Isolation）\" dir=\"auto\">第三层：执行隔离（Execution Isolation）</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> subprocess\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> tempfile\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> os\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">SandboxExecutor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"沙箱隔离执行器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>allowed_paths <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/tmp/mcp_workspace\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"/data/public\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_file_size <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">10</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">1024</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">1024</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 10MB</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_execution_time <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">30</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 30秒</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">execute_in_sandbox</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> command<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"在沙箱中执行命令\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> tempfile<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>TemporaryDirectory<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> tmpdir<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> subprocess<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>run<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                    command<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    cwd<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>tmpdir<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    capture_output<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    text<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    timeout<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max_execution_time<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token comment\"># 资源限制</span>\n                    env<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"PATH\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"/usr/bin:/bin\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 限制环境变量</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"returncode\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>returncode<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"stdout\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>stdout<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">10000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 限制输出长度</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"stderr\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>stderr<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">5000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> subprocess<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>TimeoutExpired<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"执行超时\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"returncode\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">validate_path</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> path<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"校验文件路径是否在允许范围内\"\"\"</span>\n        abs_path <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> os<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>path<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>abspath<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>path<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> allowed <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>allowed_paths<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> abs_path<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>startswith<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>os<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>path<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>abspath<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>allowed<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"第四层：审计追踪（Audit Trail）\" dir=\"auto\">第四层：审计追踪（Audit Trail）</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> hashlib\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> json\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> datetime <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> datetime\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">AuditLogger</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"审计日志系统\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> storage_backend<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>storage <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> storage_backend\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">log_tool_call</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> record<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"记录工具调用\"\"\"</span>\n        audit_entry <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"event_type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_call\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"timestamp\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> datetime<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>utcnow<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>isoformat<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"trace_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> record<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"trace_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> record<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"user_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> record<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"user_role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"tool\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> record<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"tool_name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"arguments_hash\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_hash<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>record<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"arguments\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"arguments_plain\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> record<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"arguments\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 脱敏后存储</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"result\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> record<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"latency_ms\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> record<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"latency_ms\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"context\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"session_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> record<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"session_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"client_ip\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> record<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"client_ip\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"mcp_server\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> record<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"server_name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 敏感参数脱敏</span>\n        audit_entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"tool\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"arguments_plain\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_sanitize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            record<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"arguments\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>storage<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>save<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>audit_entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_hash</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> data<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> hashlib<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>sha256<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dumps<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> sort_keys<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>encode<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>hexdigest<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">16</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_sanitize</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"脱敏处理\"\"\"</span>\n        sensitive_fields <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'password'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'token'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'secret'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'api_key'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        sanitized <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>copy<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> key <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> sanitized<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">any</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>sf <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> key<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lower<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> sf <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> sensitive_fields<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                sanitized<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>key<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"***REDACTED***\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> sanitized\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"MCP 安全最佳实践\" dir=\"auto\">MCP 安全最佳实践</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实践</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最小权限</strong></td>\n<td>每个 Agent 只配置执行任务所需的最小工具集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>文件系统隔离</strong></td>\n<td>Agent 只能在专属工作目录操作，禁止访问 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">~/.ssh</code> 等敏感目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>网络访问控制</strong></td>\n<td>配置专属 VLAN，限制访问内部核心数据库、配置中心的 IP 段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>工具清单白名单</strong></td>\n<td>在配置中明确列出可用工具清单，清单外的调用直接拦截</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>凭证管理</strong></td>\n<td>从 Agent 内部移除凭证控制权，改为通过网络边界注入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>人类介入</strong></td>\n<td>高风险操作必须经过人工确认，不能自动执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"完整安全配置示例\" dir=\"auto\">完整安全配置示例</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># config.yaml - MCP 安全配置示例</span>\nsecurity<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  authentication<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token builtin\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"oauth2\"</span>\n    required<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> true\n  \n  authorization<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    model<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"rbac\"</span>\n    roles<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"data_analyst\"</span>\n        tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"query_database\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"search_documents\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"export_csv\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        resources<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"schema://tables\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"resource://datasets/*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"system_admin\"</span>\n        tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        approval_required<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> false\n      <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"guest\"</span>\n        tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"query_public_data\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        rate_limit<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"10/min\"</span>\n  \n  sandbox<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    enabled<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> true\n    allowed_paths<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/tmp/mcp\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"/data/public\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    forbidden_commands<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"rm -rf\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"mkfs\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"dd\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    max_execution_time<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">30</span>\n  \n  audit<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    enabled<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> true\n    log_all_calls<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> true\n    retention_days<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">90</span>\n    sensitive_fields<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"password\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"token\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"secret\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 如何防止 Agent 绕过审批直接执行工具？</strong><br>\nA: 所有 ToolCall 必须经过 SecureToolExecutor 的权限和审批检查，没有直通路径。通过依赖注入确保只有该执行器被调用，并用 ArchUnit 等工具在 CI 中检查。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 什么情况下应该跳过人工审批？</strong><br>\nA: 风险等级为 LOW 和 MEDIUM 的操作通常不需要审批；紧急情况（如系统故障自动恢复）可在策略中配置跳过审批，但必须事后审计。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：安全只依赖模型的自我约束。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：安全决策必须从\"模型内部\"移到\"模型外部\"，通过框架层强制拦截。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：审计日志影响性能，可以关闭。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：审计是生产环境必需，可采用异步写入、采样记录等方式降低性能影响。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：权限控制只做到工具级别就够了。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：需要细到参数级别（如某用户只能查特定表、特定时间范围的数据）。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>","headings":[]}